# build output
/dist/
/pkgwatch
/pkgwatch.exe

# local data / bundles — never commit an advisory db or a signing key
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.key

# A real config, as opposed to the shipped example. It carries the hub's
# argon2id password hash, which has no business in a repository.
contrib/docker/pkgwatch.toml

# Deliberate deviation from spec §1, which says to commit vendor/.
# `go mod vendor` weighs 134 MB — 125 MB of it machine-generated
# modernc.org/{libc,sqlite}, one file set per GOOS/GOARCH. go.sum already pins
# every dependency by hash, so the tampering §1 is worried about is covered.
# What we give up is availability if a module is yanked. Reconsider if pkgwatch
# moves to its own repository, where the weight is contained.
/vendor/
